1
00:00:00,694 --> 00:00:04,254
(Howard:)Yeah, I've worked with Hawking,
I talked you up. He knows your research.

2
00:00:04,432 --> 00:00:06,462
(Howard:)- I think this could happen.
- He kno...?

3
00:00:06,634 --> 00:00:07,654
(Leonard:)Wow.

4
00:00:07,835 --> 00:00:11,105
Wait, now, but do you think
that's a good idea?

5
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:13,600
(Sheldon:)You know Star Trek.

6
00:00:13,774 --> 00:00:18,044
(Sheldon:)Should a guy with no name
and a red shirt really go on an expedition?

7
00:00:19,647 --> 00:00:22,547
(Raj:)Hey, don't discourage him.
This is a fantastic opportunity.

8
00:00:22,716 --> 00:00:24,776
(Sheldon:)No one asked you, Uhura.

9
00:00:28,622 --> 00:00:32,492
(Sheldon:)Would you like to hear a classic
Sheldon Cooper factoid?

10
00:00:32,660 --> 00:00:34,390
- What do you think?
- Great.

11
00:00:35,930 --> 00:00:39,300
(Sheldon:)I've been doing some reading
about vehicular safety.

12
00:00:39,467 --> 00:00:43,457
(Sheldon:)Did you know that the highest number
of drowning accidents...

13
00:00:43,637 --> 00:00:47,167
(Sheldon:)...happen on or around boats?

14
00:00:47,641 --> 00:00:51,511
(Leonard:)Interesting that you would bring that up
when I might go work on a boat.

15
00:00:51,679 --> 00:00:54,649
(Sheldon:)Well, that's the thing about factoids,
they're interesting.

16
00:00:56,684 --> 00:00:58,674
(Leonard:)I know what you're doing.

17
00:00:59,120 --> 00:01:02,520
You don't want me going on this trip
because you're afraid to be alone.

